  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 16 * 4 * 20 * 82 * 14 * 148\n\nOption 1) × ÷ + − =\n\nBy mathematical signs to sequentially replace the * signs then:\n\n⇒ 16 × __**4 ÷ 20**__ + 82 - 14 = 148\n\n⇒ __**16 ×**____** 0.2**__ + 82 - 14 = 148\n\n⇒ **__3__****__.2 __****__+ 82__** - 14 = 148\n\n⇒ __**85**____**.2 -**____** 14**__ = 148\n\n⇒ 71.2 ≠ 148\n\nOption 2) ÷ + ×− =\n\nBy mathematical signs to sequentially replace the * signs then:\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 4**__ + 20 × 82 - 14 = 148\n\n⇒ 4 + __**20 **____**×**____** 82**__ - 14 = 148\n\n⇒ __**4 + 1640**__ - 14 = 148\n\n⇒ __**1644**____** - 14**__ = 148\n\n⇒ 1630 ≠ 148\n\nOption 3) ÷ × + = −\n\nBy mathematical signs to sequentially replace the * signs then:\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 4**__ × 20 + 82 = 14 - 148\n\n⇒ __**4 ×**____** 20**__ + 82 = -134\n\n⇒ __**8**____**0 + 82**__ = -134\n\n⇒ 162 ≠ -134\n\n**Option 4) ÷ × + − =**\n\nBy mathematical signs to sequentially replace the * signs then:\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 4**__ × 20 + 82 - 14 = 148\n\n⇒ **__4 ×__****__ 20__** + 82 - 14 = 148\n\n⇒__** 8**____**0 + 82**__ - 14 = 148\n\n⇒ __**16**____**2 - 14**__ = 148\n\n⇒ 148 = 148\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"÷ × + − =\".",
